---
import SalesLayout from "../../layouts/SalesLayout.astro";

---

<SalesLayout
  title="15-Minute Quick Help"
  description="Get unstuck fast with a focused 15-minute session where we figure out exactly what’s going on and map out your next steps."
>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="quick-help-hero">

      <div class="quick-help-hero-text">
        <h1>15-Minute Quick Help</h1>

        <p class="lead">
          <b></b>Stop guessing. Get back to knitting in 15 minutes.</b><br>
          Point your camera, show me the problem, and let’s get you moving again.        </p>

        <div class="quick-help-cta">
          <a href="https://tidycal.com/quick-help/quick-help-session" class="kbm-button">Book Your 15-Minute Quick Help Session</a>
          <p class="quick-help-reassurance">
            No small talk, no sales pitches—just 15 minutes of pure troubleshooting.
          </p>
          <p class="quick-help-availability">
            I only open 5 Quick Help sessions each month.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="quick-help-image-card">
        <img
          src="/images/knit-by-machine-sue.png"
          alt="Sue helping with a knitting machine"
        />
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="quick-help-facts-row">
      <div class="fact">
        <strong>Supported Machines:</strong><br />
        Japanese, Silver Reed, Brother, Taitexma
      </div>

      <div class="fact">
        <strong>Experience:</strong><br />
        20+ years of machine knitting<br />
        15+ years teaching
      </div>

      <div class="fact">
        <strong>Guarantee:</strong><br />
        If we can’t identify the issue, your next session is free.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="quick-help-body">
      <div class="quick-help-section">
        <h2 class="text-primary">This is for you if…</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Something isn’t working</strong> (and you don’t know why)</li>
          <li><strong>You’re stuck mid-project</strong> (and don’t want to make it worse)</li>
          <li><strong>Your machine is doing something unexpected</strong> (and you’re not sure what to do next)</li>
          <li><strong>You just need a second set of eyes</strong></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="quick-help-section">
        <h2 class="text-primary">What Happens in 15 Minutes?</h2>
        <p>It’s fast, it’s focused, and it’s designed to get you back to your machine.</p>

        <div class="quick-help-steps">
          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-number">1</div>
            <div class="step-text">Show Me</div>
          </div>

          <div class="step-arrow">→</div>

          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-number">2</div>
            <div class="step-text">Quick Questions</div>
          </div>

          <div class="step-arrow">→</div>

          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-number">3</div>
            <div class="step-text">Identify Issue</div>
          </div>

          <div class="step-arrow">→</div>

          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-number">4</div>
            <div class="step-text">Get Your Plan</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p><em>You don’t need to have it all figured out before we start — just show me what’s happening.</em></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="prep-checklist">

      <h2>3 Things to Do Before We Start</h2>

      <ul>
    
        <li>
          <label>
            <input type="checkbox" />
            Have your machine set up and ready to show
          </label>
        </li>

        <li>
          <label>
            <input type="checkbox" />
            Be ready to describe what’s happening (or not happening)
          </label>
        </li>

        <li>
          <label>
            <input type="checkbox" />
            Have a photo or swatch nearby if that helps explain the issue
          </label>
        </li>
      </ul>

    </div>

    <p class="quick-help-final">
      Still stuck? Let’s fix it together.
    </p>

    <div class="quick-help-cta">
      <a href="https://tidycal.com/quick-help/quick-help-session" class="kbm-button">Book Your 15-Minute Quick HelpSession</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    .quick-help-hero {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .quick-help-hero-image img {
  width: 100%;
  display: block;
  border-radius: 12px;
  box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
}

    .quick-help-facts-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .fact {
      background: #f5f5f5;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .quick-help-hero {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .quick-help-facts-row {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    .container .lead {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      color: #374151;
    }

    .container .text-primary {
      color: var(--kbm-green, #52682d);
      margin-top: 1.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .container .text-primary:first-of-type {
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }

    .container p {
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      line-height: 1.65;
      color: #374151;
    }

    .container .kbm-button {
      background-color: #c96a4a;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-block;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .container .kbm-button:hover {
      background-color: #b85c3e;
    }

    .prep-checklist {
      background: #fff8d6; /* soft yellow */
      border: 1px solid #f0e2a0;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 20px 24px;
      margin: 30px 0;
    }

    .prep-checklist h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
      font-size: 20px;
      color: #52682d;
    }

    .prep-checklist ul {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 15px 0 0;
    }

    .prep-checklist li {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .prep-checklist input[type="checkbox"] {
      margin-right: 8px;
      transform: scale(1.1);
    }

    .prep-checklist label {
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .quick-help-steps {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin: 20px 0 30px;
}

.step {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  background: #f5f5f5;
  padding: 10px 14px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.step-number {
  background: #52682D;
  color: white;
  width: 24px;
  height: 24px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 13px;
}

.step-text {
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.step-arrow {
  font-size: 18px;
  color: #999;
}

/* Mobile: stack nicely */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .quick-help-steps {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .step-arrow {
    display: none;
  }
}

    .quick-help-body {
      max-width: 860px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .quick-help-section {
      margin: 40px 0;
      padding-left: 24px;
      padding-right: 24px;
    }

    .quick-help-section ul {
      padding-left: 24px;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    .quick-help-section li {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .quick-help-cta {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }

    .quick-help-cta .kbm-button {
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .quick-help-cta .quick-help-reassurance {
      margin-top: 8px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #777;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .quick-help-cta .quick-help-availability {
      margin-top: 6px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #52682d;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .container .quick-help-final {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 18px;
      margin: 20px 0 10px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .quick-help-image-card {
  background: #ffffff;
  padding: 8px;
  border-radius: 14px;
  box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
}

.quick-help-image-card img {
  width: 100%;
  display: block;
  border-radius: 10px;
}
  </style>

  <script is:inline>
    (function () {
      var bookUrl = "https://tidycal.com/quick-help/quick-help-session";
      function wireCard(el) {
        if (!el) return;
        el.addEventListener("click", function () {
          window.location.href = bookUrl;
        });
        el.setAttribute("role", "link");
        el.setAttribute("tabindex", "0");
        el.addEventListener("keydown", function (e) {
          if (e.key === "Enter" || e.key === " ") {
            e.preventDefault();
            window.location.href = bookUrl;
          }
        });
      }
      document.querySelectorAll(".quick-help-facts-row .fact").forEach(wireCard);
      document.querySelectorAll(".quick-help-image-card").forEach(wireCard);
    })();
  </script>
</SalesLayout>
